---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/support-pages.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="העמוד לא נמצא | GGNEWS"
  description="העמוד שחיפשתם לא נמצא במערכת GGNEWS."
>
  <main class="support-page not-found-page" id="main-content">
    <section class="not-found shell" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
      <div class="not-found__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="not-found__signal"></span>
        <span class="not-found__number">404</span>
        <img src="/assets/brand/ggnews-crest-cropped.png" alt="" />
        <span class="not-found__grid"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="not-found__copy">
        <span class="support-eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> PAGE NOT FOUND</span>
        <h1 id="not-found-title">העמוד ירד<br />מהמהדורה.</h1>
        <p>הכתובת שחיפשתם לא נמצאה במערכת. ייתכן שהעמוד הועבר, נמחק או שהקישור אינו נכון.</p>
        <div class="not-found__actions">
          <a class="primary-button" href="/">חזרה לעמוד הראשי <span aria-hidden="true">←</span></a>
          <a class="not-found__secondary" href="/about">מי אנחנו</a>
        </div>
        <div class="not-found__reference"><span>קוד מערכת</span><strong>GGN—404</strong></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

</BaseLayout>
